<title>USA: Whitman Education names Pfenniger CEO.</title>
<headline>Whitman Education names Pfenniger CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whitman Education Group Inc said Wednesday it had named Richard Pfenniger Jr to the newly created positions of chief executive officer and vice chairman.</p>
<p>Before accepting the new positions Pfenniger, 41, was chairman of IVAX Corp. He has been a Whitman director since 1992.</p>
